    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>one day i just wake up and realize everything i do is just for people who don't even see me. it's like i'm just a tool for everyone else's survival. i'm so tired of the noise and the demands. i just want everything to be quiet. i just want to be able to breathe without feeling like I'm being stepped on. what am i even supposed to do with all this?",
