      "content": "but how do i find that silence? everything here is just so loud and demanding. even when i'm alone i can feel the weight of what i have to do tomorrow or the next day. it's like there's no way to actually get away from it all. the only way i can imagine getting that peace is if i just... wasn't here to do it all anymore. is that just me being crazy?",
